     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜しだい: as soon as",
     "texto": [
      "To say something will be done right after another action: the ます stem + **しだい**: **つき しだい、 れんらく します** (as soon as I arrive, I'll get in touch).",
      "It's formal and common in notices and work communications."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜しだい で: depends on",
     "texto": [
      "To say something depends on another thing: noun + **しだい で**: **てんき しだい で、 しゅっぱつ を きめます** (depending on the weather, I'll decide when to leave).",
      "It's a way of leaving something open."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
